From: Alex Freeman <alexrfreeman@berkeley.edu>
Date: Sat, 21 Mar 2026 12:18:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add cognitive complementarity protocol to plans-to-projects
 overhaul

Extends the project model with first-class support for human/LLM
cognitive complementarity: cognitive mode field in project SUMMARY.md,
resolves_by routing in questions.md, collaborative question review
protocol, and a session-project interaction protocol (Frame/Flag/Check
beats). Updates scope, risks, success criteria, and Phase 0 design
review items accordingly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
